{"speciesId":562,"names":{"fr":"Tutafeh","es":"Yamask","en":"Yamask","ja":"デスマス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le motif de son masque est son visage quand il était humain. Parfois, il le regarde et se met à pleurer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Each of them carries a mask that used to be its face when it was human. Sometimes they look at it and cry."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est né de l’âme d’un défunt inhumé dans une tombe antique. Il a conservé ses anciens souvenirs."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves in past ages. Each retains memories of its former life."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves. Each retains memories of its former life."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves. Each retains memories of its former life."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il est né de l’âme d’un défunt inhumé dans une tombe antique. Il a conservé ses anciens souvenirs."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Almas de humanos sepultados en tumbas que han adquirido forma de Pokémon. Recuerdan su vida antes de la muerte."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"These Pokémon arose from the spirits of people interred in graves. Each retains memories of its former life."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"お墓に 埋葬された 人の 魂が ポケモンに 変化した。 死ぬ前の 記憶が 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le motif de son masque est son visage quand il était humain. Parfois, il le regarde et se met à pleurer."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su máscara representa la cara que poseía cuando era humano. A veces se le saltan las lágrimas al contemplarla."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Each of them carries a mask that used to be its face when it was human. Sometimes they look at it and cry."},{"l